# The Theorist, Jace Beleren's -6: "Draw three cards. Then put X +1/+1 counters on each creature you control, where X is
# the number of cards in your hand." Bot1 casts Jace on turn 1 and uses the +1 on turns 1, 3 and 5 (loyalty 6 after turn 5): three
# Illusions. On turn 5 with Jace at 5 the -6 is refused (it cannot be paid, CR 606.6) - the control is the same ability offered on
# turn 7 at loyalty 6. Bot2 has an Ornithopter, which gets nothing. On turn 7 Bot1 has 7 cards in hand (every turn draws one,
# Jace draws one in each of Bot2's draw steps, one Island is played a turn), so the -6 draws three (10) and X is counted
# AFTER the draw: each Illusion gets 10 counters, 11/11. Jace goes to 0 and is put into the graveyard (CR 704.5i).

